caption: Mastery Requirements
tradition-component: mastery-requirements

IQ 20, Magery 6, Thaumatology 30+, all Words at effective skill 20+, and either enchant an object or complete three castings in play, not necessarily consecutive, in which at least three required Word rolls are critical successes.
